  },
  "semantic_rules": [
    "Roles are supplied by this explicit registry; policy functions do not infer all semantics from an ID prefix.",
    "Support for a direction never confirms every child descriptor.",
    "A body or other source-native comparison does not become an aroma label.",
    "A legal explicit user expression is not removed because archived T omits it; output-policy functions cannot receive T.",
    "Current legality, evidence rows, source references, scores and within-role ranks are preserved.",
    "No learned threshold, parent partial credit, temporary broad-word weight or composite metric is introduced."
  ],
